*coffee shop

enter Bob:smiling

focus Bob
talk 早上好！来杯咖啡吗？

select {
    美式咖啡
    拿铁
    卡布奇诺
} -> coffee?

play& coffee-machine.wav

jump coffee? {
    0:americano
    1:latte
    2:cappuccino
}

americano#talk 您的冰美式来了！
jump leave

latte#talk 这是你的拿铁，奶泡打得很细腻！
jump leave

cappuccino#talk 卡布奇诺，请慢用！
leave#exit
